{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/menus/14010324_1_1.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_14010324:1:1","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:7006220:2":{"text":"비가 안 오면 좋겠다...","source_cn":"只要不下雨就好……","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"exact_hash"}}},"easter_eggs/menus/14010324_1_3.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_14010324:1:3","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:7006220:3":{"text":"목재가 젖으면 망하는 건 나라고!","source_cn":"淋湿的是木材，倒霉的是我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep4/env_story/14301225.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301225","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301225","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430122501:0":{"text":"전처럼 순찰 중이지. 그리고 비가 내리지 않게 해달라고 헥토르 님께 기도드리고 있어.","source_cn":"如之前一样在此巡查，同时向赫托祈祷不要下雨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06224F080974D8E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1430122501":{"text":"전처럼 순찰 중이지. 그리고 비가 내리지 않게 해달라고 헥토르 님께 기도드리고 있어.","source_cn":"如之前一样在此巡查，同时向赫托祈祷不要下雨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06224F080974D8E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430122502:0":{"text":"알고는 있지. 최근에 나에게 와서 이야기해준 사람도 있었어.","source_cn":"我知道一些，这段时间不时有人跑来跟我透露过一些相关消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D5A1C5D9E43115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430122503:0":{"text":"하지만... 나랑은 상관 없는 이야기야. 내가 할 수 있는 건 여기서 목재가 젖지 않게 지키는 거니까.","source_cn":"但……对我而言想再多也没用，我能做的只有保证这些木头不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE19F8B039311DEBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"마을과 지하에서 발생한 일에 대해 알아?","source_cn":"你不知道村子和地下发生的事情吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD99AC18AED026E42","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마을과 지하에서 발생한 일에 대해 알아?","female":"마을과 지하에서 발생한 일에 대해 알아?","variant_male_record_index":"72276","variant_female_record_index":"72277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/env_story/14324010.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14324010","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14324010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1432401001:0":{"text":"내 소중한 목재가 비에 젖으면 큰일이야!","source_cn":"我的宝贝木材！要被雨淋坏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67AFD7DA4C959AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/env_story/14324020.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14324020","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14324020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1432402001:0":{"text":"비가 오기 전에 비가림막 좀 설치해 달라고 그렇게 말했는데! 이러면 망하잖아!","source_cn":"我早就说该给我拨款修个雨棚，要不然一下雨这些木材都得完蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA953E7314BE404CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1432402002:0":{"text":"아, 그래. 망한건 목재뿐만이 아니지, 나도 망할거야!","source_cn":"这下好了，完蛋的不光有木材，还有我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE1317DBAC0E1F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1432402003:0":{"text":"누가 좀 마법 같은 걸 써서라도 도와줬으면... 하아, 또 말도 안 되는 꿈을 꾸고 있네 내가...","source_cn":"要是有人能帮帮我，施个魔法什么的……唉，我又在做梦了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DB575F150B0DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/env_story/14324030.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14324030","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14324030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1432403001:0":{"text":"아니, 이건 또 무슨 마법이야! 목재가 비에 젖기 전처럼 바짝 말랐잖아?","source_cn":"这是什么魔法！木材变得干燥了，还不会被雨淋湿……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA8736A59AB79E0B8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아니, 이건 또 무슨 마법이야! 목재가 비에 젖기 전처럼 바짝 말랐잖아?","female":"아니, 이건 또 무슨 마법이야! 목재가 비에 젖기 전처럼 바짝 말랐잖아?","variant_male_record_index":"167810","variant_female_record_index":"167811","document_title":"","document_title_male":